    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "At what time",
     "texto": [
      "**À quelle heure ?** = at what time? You answer with **à**: **à huit heures**.",
      "**En retard** = late: **Je suis en retard** (I am late). **Maintenant** = now.",
      "In conversation, **on** usually replaces **nous** («we»), but the verb is conjugated in the third person singular: **On déjeune ensemble ?** (shall we have lunch together?). In other contexts it can also mean «one» or «people»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
